<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="turbo-visit-control" content="reload">
  <meta name="turbo-cache" content="no-cache">
  <title><%= typeof titulo !== 'undefined' ? titulo : 'Instabilidade no Sistema | RevSys' %></title>
  
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      color: #1e293b;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    .card-erro {
      max-width: 28rem;
      width: 100%;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      padding: 2.25rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .badge-status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.375rem;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background-color: #fee2e2;
      color: #b91c1c;
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .titulo-erro {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .desc-erro {
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .acoes-grupo {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .acoes-grupo { flex-direction: row; }
    }
    .btn-principal {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background-color: #0052cc;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      border: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 82, 204, 0.2);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-principal:hover { background-color: #0047b3; }
    .btn-secundario {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #334155;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-secundario:hover { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; }
    .icone-destaque-caixa {
      width: 4.5rem;
      height: 4.5rem;
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      background-color: #fee2e2;
      color: #dc2626;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card-erro">
    <div class="icone-destaque-caixa">
      <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"></path>
        <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
        <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="badge-status">
      Instabilidade Inesperada
    </div>

    <h1 class="titulo-erro">Ops! Algo deu errado</h1>
    
    <p class="desc-erro">
      Ocorreu uma instabilidade inesperada ao processar sua requisição. O registro do evento foi salvo nos logs do servidor para rápida análise.
    </p>

    <div class="acoes-grupo">
      <button onclick="window.location.reload()" class="btn-principal">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9c2.52 0 4.93 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path>
          <path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>Tentar Novamente</span>
      </button>
      
      <a href="/painel" class="btn-secundario">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
          <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Painel Principal</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94a3b8;">
      RevSys &bull; Sistema de Gestão Preventiva AUTEC
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
